">Exam Room — SSA101</a> (4 practice papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Luyện tại <a href=\"/exam?course=SSA101\">Phòng thi — SSA101</a> (4 đề luyện: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>📑 School slides — 3. Exploring College (tiết 3) (13 slides)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">matched by the chapter number in the deck name. File: 3. Exploring College (tiết 3).pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>📑 Slide của trường — 3. Exploring College (tiết 3) (13 slide)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">ghép theo số chương ghi trong tên deck. Tệp: 3. Exploring College (tiết 3).pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d03/001.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 1: Exploring College\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 1/13</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Exploring College</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d03/002.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 2: Chapter Outline\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 2/13</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Chapter Outline<br>1. Why College?<br>2. The First Year of College Will Be an Experience<br>3. College Culture and Expectations<br>4. How Can This Book And This Course Help?</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d03/003.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 3: Question to consider\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 3/13</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Question to consider<br>How will you be able to develop your purpose?<br>In what ways will you be able to create strategies for your success?.<br>What other resources can you use to help you succeed?<br>4. How Can This Book And This Course Help?</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d03/004.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 4: Developing Your “Why”\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 4/13</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Developing Your “Why”<br>This book helps you explore and clarify your purpose for being in college.<br>Student Survey Questions allow reflection on where you are now.<br>Analysis Questions connect chapter concepts to your personal goals.<br>Understanding your “why” strengthens motivation and persistence.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d03/005.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 5: Refining Your Strategies for Success\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 5/13</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Refining Your Strategies for Success<br>Application Questions help you practice and apply chapter skills.<br>Activities offer hands‑on ways to develop strong habits.<br>Career Connection sections link academic skills with career paths.<br>Encourages strategic learning: planning, studying, self‑management.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d03/006.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 6: Using Available Resources\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 6/13</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Using Available Resources<br>The book highlights apps, tools, and campus resources that support success.<br>“Where Do You Go From Here?” sections guide next steps.<br>Success grows with support networks and available help.<br>Resources help you stay organized, resilient, and goal‑focused.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d03/007.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 7: Build Your First‑Year Action Plan\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 7/13</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Build Your First‑Year Action Plan<br>• Create a 3–6 month plan:<br>– Purpose Goal (based on your “why”).<br>– Adjustment Goal (address one challenge).<br>– Culture/Habit Goal (e.g., attend office hours monthly).<br>• Be specific: when, how often, tracking method.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d03/008.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 8: Example: First-Year Development Plan\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 8/13</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Example: First-Year Development Plan<br>SIMPLE VERSION:<br>1-MONTH PLAN3-MONTH PLAN6-MONTH PLAN 12-MONTH PLAN</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d03/009.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 9: 1-Month Plan (Month 1) – Getting Started\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 9/13</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>1-Month Plan (Month 1) – Getting Started<br>Goal: Adapt to university life and build basic habits.<br>Attend all classes and understand course requirements.<br>Join 1 club or student organization.<br>Start a daily study routine (30–45 minutes/day).<br>Practice foreign language 10 minutes/day (podcast, vocabulary).<br>Make at least 2 new friends in the same class/major</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d03/010.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 10: 3-Month Plan (Months 1–3) – Building Foundation\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 10/13</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>3-Month Plan (Months 1–3) – Building Foundation<br>Goal: Strengthen skills and academic habits.<br>Read 1 major-related book or complete 3 chapters.<br>Attend 1 workshop on soft skills (public speaking, teamwork).<br>Participate in 1 group project actively.<br>Improve foreign language:→ 2 speaking sessions/week,→ learn 20–30 new words/week.<br>Join at least 2 school events to expand connections.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d03/011.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 11: 6-Month Plan (Months 1–6) – Growing &amp; Applying\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 11/13</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>6-Month Plan (Months 1–6) – Growing &amp; Applying<br>Goal: Apply what you learned and expand experience.<br>Build a small portfolio or collection of work (reports, projects).<br>Do 1 volunteer activity or community program.<br>Present once in class or club to practice public speaking.<br>Develop friendships:→ Have a study group of 3–5 people.<br>Read 2–3 major-related books or articles monthly.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d03/012.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 12: 12-Month Plan (Full Year) – Becoming Confident &amp; Future-Ready\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 12/13</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>12-Month Plan (Full Year) – Becoming Confident &amp; Future-Ready<br>Goal: Transform into a confident, active, and skilled student.<br>Achieve intermediate level in a foreign language.<br>Have a complete first-year portfolio (projects, certificates, activities).<br>Build a network of 10–15 contacts (friends, seniors, lecturers).<br>Join or lead one club project or event.<br>Clearly identify academic direction or career interest.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d03/013.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 13\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">3. Exploring College (tiết 3) · slide 13/13</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>📑 School slides — 13. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 1) (7 slides)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">matched by content (deck title ↔ session topic). File: 13. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 1).pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>📑 Slide của trường — 13. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 1) (7 slide)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">ghép theo nội dung (tên deck ↔ chủ đề buổi). Tệp: 13. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 1).pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d13/001.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 13. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 1) · slide 1: Academic Development Group Project\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">13. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 1) · slide 1/7</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Academic Development Group Project</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d13/002.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 13. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 1) · slide 2: Infomation\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">13. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 1) · slide 2/7</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Infomation<br>Type: Academic Development Project<br>Weight: 50%<br>Components: Proposal + Presentation + Final Report<br>Requirement: 3–5 students per group.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d13/003.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 13. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 1) · slide 3: Purpose\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">13. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 1) · slide 3/7</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Purpose<br>Help students apply academic skills to real university challenges.<br>Design an academic initiative promoting:<br>Effective learning<br>Digital literacy<br>Responsible AI use<br>Academic integrity<br>University engagement</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d13/004.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 13. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 1) · slide 4: Task Description\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">13. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 1) · slide 4/7</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Task Description<br>Work from Week 4–10 based on approved proposal.<br>In the final two weeks, each team must:<br>Evaluate implementation<br>Complete Final Report<br>Present results in class</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d13/005.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 13. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 1) · slide 5: Possible project products:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">13. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 1) · slide 5/7</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Possible project products:<br>Educational media (podcasts, videos, guides)<br>AI literacy projects<br>Peer-learning/programs<br>Research-based mini studies<br>Educational media products<br>……</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d13/006.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 13. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 1) · slide 6: Examples of Projects\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">13. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 1) · slide 6/7</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Examples of Projects<br>Study Skills Podcast<br>“AI Smart – Not AI Cheat” Campaign<br>Time Management Toolkit<br>Stress-Free Study Corner<br>Learning Analytics Survey</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d13/007.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 13. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 1) · slide 7\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">13. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 1) · slide 7/7</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>📑 School slides — 14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2) (10 slides)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">matched by content (deck title ↔ session topic). File: 14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2).pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>📑 Slide của trường — 14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2) (10 slide)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">ghép theo nội dung (tên deck ↔ chủ đề buổi). Tệp: 14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2).pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d14/001.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2) · slide 1: Academic Development Group Project\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2) · slide 1/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Academic Development Group Project</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d14/002.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2) · slide 2: Infomation\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2) · slide 2/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Infomation<br>Type: Academic Development Project<br>Weight: 50%<br>Components: Proposal + Presentation + Final Report<br>Requirement: 3–5 students per group.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d14/003.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2) · slide 3: Purpose\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2) · slide 3/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Purpose<br>Help students apply academic skills to real university challenges.<br>Design an academic initiative promoting:<br>Effective learning<br>Digital literacy<br>Responsible AI use<br>Academic integrity<br>University engagement</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d14/004.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2) · slide 4: Brainstorming: How to Generate Project Ideas\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2) · slide 4/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Brainstorming: How to Generate Project Ideas<br>1. Define the goal<br>Know the problem or topic you want to explore.<br>2. Share freely<br>List all ideas without judging or filtering.<br>3. Build on each other’s ideas<br>Combine, improve, and expand suggestions.<br>4. Group &amp; organize<br>Cluster similar ideas into themes.<br>5. Select the best idea<br>Choose based on feasibility, impact, and resources.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d14/005.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2) · slide 5: Define the goal\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2) · slide 5/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Define the goal<br>- Clearly state the problem, need, or topic you want to address.<br>- Ask guiding questions:<br>What issue are we trying to solve?<br>Who is affected by this problem?<br>What is the expected outcome of the project?<br>- A clear goal helps keep ideas focused and relevant.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d14/006.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2) · slide 6: Share freely\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2) · slide 6/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Share freely<br>- Encourage everyone to contribute ideas openly.<br>- No judging, criticizing, or filtering at this stage.<br>- Quantity matters more than quality at first.<br>- Even unusual or unrealistic ideas can spark creative solutions later.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d14/007.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2) · slide 7: Build on each other’s ideas\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2) · slide 7/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Build on each other’s ideas<br>- Listen actively to others’ ideas.<br>- Combine related ideas or improve them together.<br>How can this idea be expanded?<br>Can two ideas be merged into one stronger concept?<br>- Collaboration often leads to more innovative outcomes.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d14/008.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2) · slide 8: Group &amp; Organize\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2) · slide 8/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Group &amp; Organize<br>- Review all generated ideas.-<br>- Cluster similar ideas into themes or categories.<br>- Identify patterns, overlaps, or common directions.<br>- This step helps make a large number of ideas manageable and structured.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d14/009.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2) · slide 9: Select the Best Idea\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2) · slide 9/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Select the Best Idea<br>- Evaluate ideas based on:<br>Feasibility: Can it realistically be done?<br>Impact: How valuable or meaningful is it?<br>Resources: Time, budget, skills, and tools available.<br>- Select the idea that best fits the project goals and constraints.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d14/010.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2) · slide 10\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">14. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 2) · slide 10/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>📑 School slides — 15. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 3) (8 slides)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">matched by content (deck title ↔ session topic). File: 15. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 3).pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>📑 Slide của trường — 15. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 3) (8 slide)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">ghép theo nội dung (tên deck ↔ chủ đề buổi). Tệp: 15. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 3).pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d15/001.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 15. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 3) · slide 1: Academic Development Group Project\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">15. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 3) · slide 1/8</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Academic Development Group Project</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d15/002.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 15. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 3) · slide 2: Infomation\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">15. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 3) · slide 2/8</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Infomation<br>Type: Academic Development Project<br>Weight: 50%<br>Components: Proposal + Presentation + Final Report<br>Requirement: 3–5 students per group.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d15/003.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 15. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 3) · slide 3: Purpose\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">15. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 3) · slide 3/8</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Purpose<br>Help students apply academic skills to real university challenges.<br>Design an academic initiative promoting:<br>Effective learning<br>Digital literacy<br>Responsible AI use<br>Academic integrity<br>University engagement</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d15/004.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 15. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 3) · slide 4: Task Description\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">15. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 3) · slide 4/8</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Task Description<br>Work from Week 4–10 based on approved proposal.<br>In the final two weeks, each team must:<br>Evaluate implementation<br>Complete Final Report<br>Present results in class</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d15/005.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 15. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 3) · slide 5: Plan of Project – Writing Guide\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">15. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 3) · slide 5/8</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Plan of Project – Writing Guide<br>1. Project Overview<br>Briefly introduce the project topic<br>State the problem or need being addressed<br>2. Objectives<br>Define clear, measurable goals<br>Explain what the project aims to achieve<br>3. Target Audience<br>Identify who will benefit from the project<br>Describe their needs and relevance<br>4. Implementation Plan<br>Key activities and timeline<br>Roles and responsibilities<br>Tools, methods, and resources<br>5. Expected Outcomes<br>Project deliverables<br>Impact on students or learning environment<br>6. Evaluation Plan<br>How success will be measured<br>Data collection or feedback methods</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d15/006.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 15. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 3) · slide 6: Presentation Requirements for Reporting the Final Project Outcomes\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">15. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 3) · slide 6/8</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Presentation Requirements for Reporting the Final Project Outcomes<br>Duration: 15-30 minutes per group + Q&amp;A<br>Include:<br>Overview of project<br>Purpose and target audience<br>Implementation process<br>Results &amp; achievements<br>Reflections &amp; challenges<br>AI tools used (if any – must be ethical)<br>Use slides + practical demo/video (optional)</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d15/007.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 15. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 3) · slide 7: Final Report Structure\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">15. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 3) · slide 7/8</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Final Report Structure<br>Length: 2,200–3,000 words<br>APA 7th citation required.<br>1. Preliminary Section<br>Suggested Word Count<br>Title Page<br>Table of Contents<br>Executive Summary<br>150–250<br>2. Body<br>Introduction<br>200–300<br>Background and Rationale<br>300–400<br>Objectives<br>100–150<br>Methodology / Implementation Plan<br>400–600<br>Results<br>300–500<br>Discussion<br>300–500<br>Limitations<br>100–200<br>Conclusion<br>150–250<br>Recommendations<br>150–250<br>3. Supplementary Section<br>Team Contribution Report<br>Appendices (questionnaires, campaign screenshots, posters…)<br>References (APA 7th)</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d15/008.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 15. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 3) · slide 8\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">15. Academic Development Group Project (tiết 3) · slide 8/8</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
