    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SSA101 · Assessment 7/7</span>\n<h2>Final Exam</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13785 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SSA101 · Đầu điểm 7/7</span>\n<h2>Final Exam</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13785 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">Final exam</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">25.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">60'</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1-LO10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Multiple choices, marked by computer</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">50</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">concepts, algorithms; all studied chapters</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">by exam board, using computer</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">The exam questions must be updated or different at least 70% to the previous ones.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 55 — Group Project Part 3: Presentation &amp; Final report of group project</li><li>Session 56 — Group Project Part 3: Presentation &amp; Final report of group project</li><li>Session 57 — Group Project Part 3: Presentation &amp; Final report of group project</li><li>Session 58 — Group Project Part 3: Presentation &amp; Final report of group project (cont)</li><li>Session 59 — Group Project Part 3: Presentation &amp; Final report of group project (cont)</li><li>Session 60 — Revise course content and prepare for the final examination.</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 55 — Group Project Part 3: Presentation &amp; Final report of group project</li><li>Buổi 56 — Group Project Part 3: Presentation &amp; Final report of group project</li><li>Buổi 57 — Group Project Part 3: Presentation &amp; Final report of group project</li><li>Buổi 58 — Group Project Part 3: Presentation &amp; Final report of group project (cont)</li><li>Buổi 59 — Group Project Part 3: Presentation &amp; Final report of group project (cont)</li><li>Buổi 60 — Revise course content and prepare for the final examination.</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practice papers: <a href=\"/exam?course=SSA101\">Exam Room — SSA101</a> (4 papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Đề luyện: <a href=\"/exam?course=SSA101\">Phòng thi — SSA101</a> (4 đề: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
