    "content": "<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d36/001.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 35. Project Evaluation Framework for Phase 4 Implementation · slide 1: Evaluation Framework for Phase 4 Implementation\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">35. Project Evaluation Framework for Phase 4 Implementation · slide 1/8</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Evaluation Framework for Phase 4 Implementation<br>ACADEMIC DEVELOPMENT GROUP PROJECT</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d36/002.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 35. Project Evaluation Framework for Phase 4 Implementation · slide 2: Plan of Project – Writing Guide\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">35. Project Evaluation Framework for Phase 4 Implementation · slide 2/8</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Plan of Project – Writing Guide<br>1. Project Overview<br>Briefly introduce the project topic<br>State the problem or need being addressed<br>2. Objectives<br>Define clear, measurable goals<br>Explain what the project aims to achieve<br>3. Target Audience<br>Identify who will benefit from the project<br>Describe their needs and relevance<br>4. Implementation Plan<br>Key activities and timeline<br>Roles and responsibilities<br>Tools, methods, and resources<br>5. Expected Outcomes<br>Project deliverables<br>Impact on students or learning environment<br>6. Evaluation Plan<br>How success will be measured<br>Data collection or feedback methods</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d36/003.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 35. Project Evaluation Framework for Phase 4 Implementation · slide 3: Evaluation of Phase 4 Effectiveness\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">35. Project Evaluation Framework for Phase 4 Implementation · slide 3/8</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>Evaluation of Phase 4 Effectiveness<br>PHASE 4: IMPLEMENTATION PLAN</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d36/004.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 35. Project Evaluation Framework for Phase 4 Implementation · slide 4: 1. Progress Tracking\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">35. Project Evaluation Framework for Phase 4 Implementation · slide 4/8</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>1. Progress Tracking<br>Evaluation Focus:<br>Monitor whether activities are completed according to the planned timeline.<br>Evaluation Criteria:<br>100% on-time completion of scheduled activities.<br>Acceptable delay: ≤ 10% of planned duration.<br>Delay &gt; 10% indicates need for intervention or plan adjustment.<br>Task completion rate:<br>≥ 90%: Excellent<br>70–89%: Satisfaction<br>&lt; 70%: Needs improvement</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d36/005.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 35. Project Evaluation Framework for Phase 4 Implementation · slide 5: 2. Role Performance\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">35. Project Evaluation Framework for Phase 4 Implementation · slide 5/8</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>2. Role Performance<br>Evaluation Focus:<br>Assess how well team members fulfill their assigned responsibilities.<br>Evaluation Criteria:<br>Tasks completed fully and correctly.<br>Work performed according to required procedures.<br>Demonstrates teamwork: participation, communication, support.<br>Shows initiative: solves minor issues independently, reports major obstacles promptly.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d36/006.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 35. Project Evaluation Framework for Phase 4 Implementation · slide 6: 3. Output Quality\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">35. Project Evaluation Framework for Phase 4 Implementation · slide 6/8</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>3. Output Quality<br>Evaluation Focus:<br>Evaluate the quality of deliverables produced in Phase 4.<br>Evaluation Criteria:<br>Outputs meet the defined requirements and objectives.<br>High accuracy (error-free, correct data).<br>Practical usefulness and relevance to project goals.<br>Completeness: minimal revisions required.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d36/007.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 35. Project Evaluation Framework for Phase 4 Implementation · slide 7: 4. Tools &amp; Resource Efficiency\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">35. Project Evaluation Framework for Phase 4 Implementation · slide 7/8</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>4. Tools &amp; Resource Efficiency<br>Evaluation Focus:<br>Examine how effectively tools, methods, and resources are utilized.<br>Evaluation Criteria:<br>Appropriateness of tools for specific tasks.<br>Efficiency: tools/resources save time or improve quality.<br>Correct and safe usage by team members.<br>Optimization: minimal waste of time, budget, or manpower.</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SSA101/flm1/d36/008.webp\" alt=\"SSA101 · 35. Project Evaluation Framework for Phase 4 Implementation · slide 8\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">35. Project Evaluation Framework for Phase 4 Implementation · slide 8/8</p></div>"
